LeanExe/Native/Clight/

The files Integers.lean, Floats.lean, AST.lean, Values.lean, Memdata.lean, Memory.lean,
Ctypes.lean, Globalenvs.lean, Events.lean, Cop.lean, Clight.lean, and Bigstep.lean in
LeanExe/Native/Clight/ transcribe definitions of the CompCert verified compiler, release 3.18,
into Lean, and are a derived work of it.  CompCert is Copyright Institut National de Recherche en
Informatique et en Automatique (INRIA) and AbsInt Angewandte Informatik GmbH.

